### User Profile Image Management Endpoints
### Test file for profile image upload/delete in User Management

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5244
@bearerToken = <your_jwt_token_here>

### 1. Upload Profile Image for a User
### POST: /api/user/{userId}/upload-profile-image
### Form Data: file (multipart form)
###
### Example: Upload profile image for user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/user/{userId}/upload-profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. Delete Profile Image for a User
### DELETE: /api/user/{userId}/delete-profile-image
### 
### Example: Delete profile image for user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/user/{userId}/delete-profile-image
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Notes:
### - Replace {userId} with actual user GUID
### - Replace {{bearerToken}} with actual JWT token
### - File must be jpg, jpeg, png, or gif
### - Maximum file size: 5MB
### - Endpoint requires JWT authentication
### - User's dtUpdatedOn and strUpdatedByGUID will be updated with current timestamp and current user ID
